00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:34,390
我知道咱俩看对方都不顺眼
I know you and I haven't gotten along,

347
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:35,630
但帮个忙
but quick fave.

348
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:37,370
我得帮我朋友解决点事
I need to fix something for my friend.

349
00:15:37,650 --> 00:15:40,390
我能过去跟那个人说句话吗 拜托了
Can I just go over there and talk to that guy, please?

350
00:15:40,530 --> 00:15:41,430
你在名单上吗
Are you on the list?

351
00:15:43,330 --> 00:15:44,570
我从未在名单上
I've never been on the list.

352
00:15:49,370 --> 00:15:51,210
我可以这样一天也不累 宝贝
I can do this all day, sweetheart.

353
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:52,950
我可是同性恋伦巴舞冠军
I'm a gay rumba champion.

354
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:06,390
你好 我是你的服务员麦克斯
Hi, I'm Max. I'll be your server.

355
00:16:07,010 --> 00:16:09,770
今天的例汤是"请不要毁了我朋友卡洛琳的机会
Today's soup is "Please don't ruin my friend Caroline's chance,

356
00:16:09,910 --> 00:16:10,810
一切都是我的错"
it's all my fault."

357
00:16:12,770 --> 00:16:14,590
当然 这是纯素 不含"奶"
And, of course, it's vegan, no dairy.

358
00:16:15,690 --> 00:16:16,870
这是什么情况
What's going on here?

359
00:16:17,210 --> 00:16:18,930
先生 我真的做错了
Sir, I really screwed up,

360
00:16:18,930 --> 00:16:20,990
我昨天冲着你车的排烟管大喊
and as I screamed into your muffler yesterday,

361
00:16:21,670 --> 00:16:23,350
现在我来恳求你的原谅
I am here to beg your forgiveness.

362
00:16:23,810 --> 00:16:25,050
我不是在说你
I wasn't talking about you.

363
00:16:25,230 --> 00:16:26,210
我是说 为什么我的桌子上会有面包
I meant, why is there bread on my table?

364
00:16:28,030 --> 00:16:29,810
再给她一次机会吧
Give her another chance.

365
00:16:30,190 --> 00:16:31,590
这是她失去万贯家财后
This is the first good thing to happen to her

366
00:16:31,590 --> 00:16:32,910
第一次有好事降临
since she lost all her money,

367
00:16:33,110 --> 00:16:35,410
红十字会给我们咖啡那事就先不提了[捐血]
aside from the time the Red Cross gave us coffee.

368
00:16:37,110 --> 00:16:38,750
至少跟她见个面
At least meet with her,

369
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:41,250
这样你就能听听她的故事有多了不起
so you can hear how amazing her story is.

370
00:16:41,510 --> 00:16:43,810
这个故事讲述的是一个人重获新生
It's a story of someone not being defined

371
00:16:43,810 --> 00:16:46,270
昨日种种譬如昨日死
by all the bad things that have happened to them in the past

372
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:48,090
今日种种譬如今日生
and just moving on.

373
00:16:48,570 --> 00:16:49,890
拍成电影我会买票看哦
I'd buy a ticket to that.

374
00:16:51,330 --> 00:16:52,330
佩里 这是什么情况
Perry, what's happening here?

375
00:16:52,330 --> 00:16:53,210
为什么你的桌子上会有面包
Why is there bread on your table?

376
00:16:54,290 --> 00:16:55,930
这个姑娘试图说服我
This girl keeps trying to convince me

377
00:16:55,930 --> 00:16:57,390
跟她的朋友见个面
to have a meeting with her friend.

378
00:16:58,370 --> 00:16:59,670
我很久没见过有服务员这么不要脸了
I haven't seen a waitress this desperate

379
00:16:59,670 --> 00:17:03,193
上一次还是昨晚莎侬·多赫提偷塞给我她的大头照
since Shannen Doherty slipped me her head shot last night.

380
00:17:04,670 --> 00:17:05,870
作为你的律师
Well, as your lawyer,

381
00:17:06,430 --> 00:17:08,330
我建议你 她要什么你就给什么
I recommend you give her exactly what she wants.

382
00:17:08,910 --> 00:17:09,687
肯定不会后悔
You won't be sorry.

383
00:17:09,687 --> 00:17:11,659
我就不后悔
I wasn't.

384
00:17:14,330 --> 00:17:15,510
明天11点来找我
Come back tomorrow at 11:00.

385
00:17:15,770 --> 00:17:18,950
你们可能得等一会 但我会挤时间见你们
You guys may have to wait, but I'll squeeze you in.

386
00:17:19,370 --> 00:17:21,250
天啊 非常感谢
Oh, my... thank you so much.

387
00:17:22,050 --> 00:17:23,610
现在我得去找我的朋友了
Now, I have to go find my friend

388
00:17:23,610 --> 00:17:26,370
得赶在她不小心"意外滑倒坠楼"之前找到她
before she accidentally slips and falls off the terrace.

389
00:17:28,130 --> 00:17:29,990
麦克斯 等等
Max, hold up.

390
00:17:30,850 --> 00:17:32,350
你刚才的行为很酷
That was really cool of you.

391
00:17:32,710 --> 00:17:35,050
就连你不打电话给我 我也不会觉得不爽了
I'm not even upset anymore that you didn't call me.

392
00:17:35,570 --> 00:17:37,170
我不想一上来就追得这么紧
I didn't want to come on too strong.

393
00:17:37,170 --> 00:17:40,585
我是不是不该听从大卫·斯佩德的约会建议
Should I not have taken dating advice from David Spade?

394
00:17:42,456 --> 00:17:44,545
我得接个电话
Ooh, I got to take this.

395
00:17:45,050 --> 00:17:45,750
当然
Of course you do.

396
00:17:54,850 --> 00:17:55,450
你好
Hello?

397
00:17:57,290 --> 00:17:59,250
是我
Hey, it's me.

398
00:18:00,910 --> 00:18:01,930
今晚能见面吗
Can I see you tonight?

399
00:18:02,610 --> 00:18:03,990
这也是大卫·斯佩德给你的建议吗
Did you get that from David Spade?

400
00:18:05,630 --> 00:18:07,230
那都是跟斯塔莫斯学的 宝贝
That's all Stamos, baby.

401
00:18:10,650 --> 00:18:13,470
你确定这不是又一次假安排的会面吗
And you're sure it's not another fake meeting?

402
00:18:13,570 --> 00:18:15,410
因为全打给我来确认
Because Quan called me to confirm,

403
00:18:15,730 --> 00:18:16,710
那反倒让我好紧张啊
and that makes me nervous.

404
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:19,570
兰迪说这次会面是来真的
Randy says the meeting's legit.

405
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:21,249
最后是
And turns out

406
00:18:21,249 --> 00:18:24,690
你有了一个洛城男友
you may have an LA BF.

407
00:18:24,690 --> 00:18:26,570
他不是我的男友
Um, he is not my BF.

408
00:18:27,050 --> 00:18:28,830
因为"男"指的是"男孩"
Because B stands for "Boy,"

409
00:18:28,850 --> 00:18:30,550
那家伙可是个爷们
And that guy is a ma-an.

410
00:18:33,410 --> 00:18:34,970
你的行李有好消息了
Good news about your luggage.

411
00:18:35,150 --> 00:18:36,130
像年轻的我
Like a young me,

412
00:18:36,130 --> 00:18:38,610
完整到达洛杉矶
it arrived in Los Angeles in one piece...

413
00:18:38,810 --> 00:18:40,050
只是多了几个洞
with a few holes in it.

414
00:18:40,870 --> 00:18:41,930
这是你的 对吗
This is you, right?

415
00:18:41,930 --> 00:18:43,450
当然看起来像我啦
Sure looks like me.

416
00:18:43,610 --> 00:18:45,330
麦克斯 你把制服都带来啦
Max, you packed your waitress uniform?

417
00:18:46,110 --> 00:18:48,430
诡异的是 我没有啊
The weird thing is, I didn't.

418
00:18:50,430 --> 00:18:52,450
我猜我可能永远都逃不开那个命运的纠缠
I guess I'm never getting away from that life.

419
00:18:52,790 --> 00:18:54,290
你会的 我们可是在好莱坞
Yes, you will. We're in Hollywood.

420
00:18:54,450 --> 00:18:55,470
一切皆有可能
Anything can happen.

421
00:18:55,870 --> 00:18:57,650
劳伦斯 你的试镜怎么样
Oh, Lawrence, how did your audition go?

422
00:18:57,710 --> 00:18:58,990
没成功
I didn't get it.

423
00:18:59,010 --> 00:19:01,330
或许那个角色不适合你
Oh, well, maybe it wasn't the right role for you.

424
00:19:01,330 --> 00:19:01,950
是演什么啊
What was it?

425
00:19:02,130 --> 00:19:04,290
一个酒店的菲律宾同性恋总经理
The Filipino gay general manager of a hotel

426
00:19:04,290 --> 00:19:05,190
以前曾经是直男
who used to be straight.

427
00:19:08,070 --> 00:19:09,770
下一个 下一个角色肯定行
Next one. You'll get the next one.

428
00:19:10,650 --> 00:19:13,270
既然现在你的电影有得谈 可别忘了我哟
Well, now that your movie's back on, keep me in mind.

429
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:14,730
我真的是一个好演员呢
I really am a good actor.

430
00:19:15,010 --> 00:19:17,470
就像现在 我在演我一点也不难过
Like right now, I'm acting like I'm not depressed.

431
00:19:20,370 --> 00:19:21,450
我们出去玩吧
Let's go out.

432
00:19:21,650 --> 00:19:22,930
做一些好莱坞的事情
Let's do Hollywood stuff.

433
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:26,190
去格里菲斯天文台 或看看大个小子被枪杀的地方
Let's go to the Observatory or see where Biggie got murdered.

434
00:19:27,370 --> 00:19:27,810
好啊
Okay!

435
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:29,790
我找件衣服穿
Let me just grab something to wear.

436
00:19:31,230 --> 00:19:33,390
天啊 我希望别是劳伦斯
Oh, my God. I hope that isn't Lawrence

437
00:19:33,390 --> 00:19:34,950
又说他需要这房间空出一个小时
saying that he needs the place for an hour

438
00:19:34,950 --> 00:19:36,950
因为本·阿弗莱克跟保姆来了
because Ben Affleck is here with a nanny...

439
00:19:38,750 --> 00:19:40,670
裘德·洛跟保姆来了
Jude Law is here with a nanny...

440
00:19:41,154 --> 00:19:44,540
加文·罗斯代尔跟保姆来了
Gavin Rossdale is here with a nanny.

441
00:19:45,870 --> 00:19:47,010
姑娘们
Hi, girls.

442
00:19:50,050 --> 00:19:53,010
我们老家也有位女士长得很像你
Hey, we've got a lady that looks like you at home.

443
00:19:54,390 --> 00:19:57,030
这房间好漂漂
Wow, nice room.

444
00:19:57,330 --> 00:19:58,910
苏菲 你来这里干什么
Sophie, what are you doing here?

445
00:19:59,530 --> 00:20:03,270
在麦克斯说服我不要领养之后...
Well, after Max talked me into not adopting...

446
00:20:03,270 --> 00:20:05,050
-我有吗 -有啊
- I did? - You did.

447
00:20:07,170 --> 00:20:10,430
我在巴诺电子书店上做了点小调查
Well, I did a little research on my Barnes and Noble Nook.

448
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:11,910
你们要一本吗
Do you want one?

449
00:20:12,150 --> 00:20:14,690
我猜他们现在正免费发放呢
I guess they're just giving them away right now.

450
00:20:16,190 --> 00:20:16,910
不了 谢谢
No, thanks.

451
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:18,711
我更倾向用传统的方式
I prefer to lie about the books I've read

452
00:20:18,711 --> 00:20:20,736
就我看过的书撒谎
the old-fashioned way.

453
00:20:21,150 --> 00:20:24,050
我发现所有这些好莱坞演员
Well, it turns out all of these Hollywood actresses

454
00:20:24,650 --> 00:20:28,110
都是超过40岁之后才要孩子 比如吉娜·戴维斯
that are having babies over 40, like Geena Davis,

455
00:20:29,130 --> 00:20:32,310
珍·西摩尔 尼尔·帕特里克·哈里斯[同性恋男演员]
Jane Seymour, Neil Patrick Harris,

456
00:20:33,830 --> 00:20:38,310
他们都找的是这里的一位治疗师
well, they're all going to this big-shot healer out here,

457
00:20:38,310 --> 00:20:41,210
所以我来了
so here I am.

458
00:20:42,230 --> 00:20:44,430
我跟你们待在一起 可以吧
It's cool if I stay with you, right?

459
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,590
-当然 -十分肯定
- Absolutely. - Set in stone.

460
00:20:46,770 --> 00:20:48,090
我们都迫不及待了呢
We're so excited.
